  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Possibility, trend and certainty",
     "texto": [
      "**kan** expresses possibility or ability; **vil** can indicate future or willingness; **forventes at** presents an attributed forecast. Don't translate them as if they stated the same degree of certainty."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Naming the change",
     "texto": [
      "In informative texts names like **udvikling** (development), **arbejdskraft** (workforce) and **uddannelse** (training) appear. Connect each noun with who acts and what changes."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
